// Windows resource script, configured by ui/CMakeLists.txt so the icon path is
// absolute (rc.exe resolves relative paths against the build directory, not
// against this file).
//
// The shell reads the icon for the executable file, a pinned shortcut and a
// grouped taskbar button from this resource table, not from
// QApplication::setWindowIcon -- that only reaches the window title bar. ID 1 is
// the first icon in the group table, which is the one Explorer and the shell
// pick by default.
1 ICON "@LNB_APP_ICON@"
